{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Lane Racer — default question bank",
    "author": "",
    "updated": "2026-09-06",
    "howToEdit": [
      "Questions are grouped by subject. The subject name is what appears on the sign banner header.",
      "id must be unique across the whole file — results are recorded against it.",
      "answer is the correct one; distractors must hold exactly (lanes - 1) wrong answers, so 2 for a three-lane road.",
      "level 1 is easy, 2 medium, 3 harder. The game unlocks tiers as the stage number climbs.",
      "Answers sit on a road sign roughly one lane wide. Keep them under about 12 characters — the renderer shrinks longer text, but it gets hard to read at speed.",
      "Add a whole new subject by adding a new key under sets; nothing else needs changing."
    ],
    "maxAnswerChars": 12
  },
